"PaddleOCR-VL-1.5：面向真实场景文档解析的多任务 0.9B 视觉语言模型 | ERNIE Blog (https://ernie.baidu.com/blog/zh/posts/paddleocr-vl-1.5/)\nciteturn31408view0 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 2 days ago; Content type: text/html; Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"https://ernie.baidu.com/blog/zh/posts/paddleocr-vl-1.5/\",\"lineno\":45}); Total lines: 250\nL0:   * cite0†论文 L1:   * cite1†关于 L2:   * cite2†文心助手†wenxin.baidu.com L3: \nL4:     * cite3†EN L5: \nL6: # PaddleOCR-VL-1.5：面向真实场景文档解析的多任务 0.9B 视觉语言模型\nL7: \nL8: 2026年1月29日 · 3 分钟 | 语言:\nL9: \nL10:   * cite4†EN L11: \nL12: cite5†Demo†huggingface.co | cite6†GitHub†github.com | cite7†Hugging Face†huggingface.co | cite8†Technical Report†arxiv.org |🔥cite9†Official Website†aistudio.baidu.com L13: \nL14: cite10†Image: metrics L15: ## 引言cite11†# L16: \nL17: PaddleOCR-VL-1.5 是 PaddleOCR-VL 的一次重要升级，在 OmniDocBench v1.5 上达到了 94.5% 的全新 SOTA 准确率。为了系统性评估模型在真实世界物理畸变条件下的鲁棒性（包括扫描伪影、倾斜、弯折、屏幕拍照以及光线变化），我们提出了 Real5-OmniDocBench 基准。实验结果表明，该增强模型在这一全新构建的基准上同样取得了 SOTA 表现。此外，我们在保持 0.9B 超紧凑 VLM 与高推理效率的前提下，进一步扩展了模型能力，引入了 印章识别（Seal Recognition） 与 文本检测识别一体化（Text Spotting） 等任务。\nL18: ### PaddleOCR-VL-1.5 的核心能力cite12†# L19: \nL20:   1. 在仅 0.9B 参数规模下，PaddleOCR-VL-1.5 在 OmniDocBench v1.5 上取得 94.5% 准确率，超越此前的 SOTA 模型 PaddleOCR-VL，并在 表格、公式与文本识别 等任务上取得显著提升。\nL21:   2. 提出了一种 支持不规则形状定位的文档解析新范式，能够在文档倾斜、弯折等复杂条件下进行精确的多边形检测。在扫描、倾斜、弯折、屏幕拍照与光线变化五类真实场景评测中，整体性能显著优于主流开源与商用模型。\nL22:   3. 新增 文本检测识别一体化（文本行级定位 + 识别） 与 印章识别 能力，并在对应任务指标上均刷新 SOTA。\nL23:   4. 在 专业场景与多语言识别能力 上进一步增强：针对 古籍文本、多语言表格、下划线与复选框 的识别效果显著提升，并新增对 藏文与孟加拉文 的语言支持。\nL24:   5. 支持 跨页表格自动合并 与 跨页段落标题识别，有效缓解 长文档解析 中的内容割裂问题。\nL25: \nL26: ### 模型架构cite13†# L27: \nL28: cite14†Image: architecture L29: \nL30: ## 使用方法cite15†# L31: ### 安装依赖cite16†# L32: 安装 cite17†PaddlePaddle†www.paddlepaddle.org.cn 与 cite6†PaddleOCR†github.com ：\nL33: \nL34:     `# The following command installs the PaddlePaddle version for CUDA 12.6. For other CUDA versions and the CPU version, please refer to https://www.paddlepaddle.org.cn/en/install/quick?docurl=/documentation/docs/en/develop/install/pip/linux-pip_en.html\nL35:     python -m pip install paddlepaddle-gpu==3.2.1 -i https://www.paddlepaddle.org.cn/packages/stable/cu126/\nL36:     python -m pip install -U \"paddleocr[doc-parser]\"\nL37:     `\nL38: > 请确保安装 PaddlePaddle 3.2.1 或更高版本，并搭配特殊版本的 safetensors。 macOS 用户请使用 Docker 搭建环境。\nL39: ### 基础用法cite18†# L40: \nL41: CLI：\nL42: \nL43:     `paddleocr doc_parser -i https://paddle-model-ecology.bj.bcebos.com/paddlex/imgs/demo_image/paddleocr_vl_demo.png\nL44:     `\nL45: \nL46: Python API：\nL47: \nL48:     `from paddleocr import PaddleOCRVL\nL49:     pipeline = PaddleOCRVL()\nL50:     output = pipeline.predict(\"https://paddle-model-ecology.bj.bcebos.com/paddlex/imgs/demo_image/paddleocr_vl_demo.png\")\nL51:     for res in output:\nL52:         res.print()\nL53:         res.save_to_json(save_path=\"output\")\nL54:         res.save_to_markdown(save_path=\"output\")\nL55:     `\nL56: ### 通过优化推理服务加速 VLM 推理cite19†# L57: \nL58:   1. 启动 VLM 推理服务：\nL59: \nL60: 可以用以下两种方式启动 vLLM 推理服务：\nL61: \nL62:      * 方法 1：PaddleOCR 方式\nL63: \nL64:         `docker run \\\nL65:             --rm \\\nL66:             --gpus all \\\nL67:             --network host \\\nL68:             ccr-2vdh3abv-pub.cnc.bj.baidubce.com/paddlepaddle/paddleocr-genai-vllm-server:latest-nvidia-gpu \\\nL69:             paddleocr genai_server --model_name PaddleOCR-VL-1.5-0.9B --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8080 --backend vllm\nL70:         `\nL71: \nL72:      * 方法 2：vLLM 方式\nL73: \nL74: cite20†vLLM: PaddleOCR-VL Usage Guide†docs.vllm.ai L75:   2. 调用 PaddleOCR CLI 或 Python API：\nL76: \nL77:     `paddleocr doc_parser \\\nL78:         -i https://paddle-model-ecology.bj.bcebos.com/paddlex/imgs/demo_image/paddleocr_vl_demo.png \\\nL79:         --vl_rec_backend vllm-server \\\nL80:         --vl_rec_server_url http://127.0.0.1:8080/v1\nL81:     `\nL82: \nL83:     `from paddleocr import PaddleOCRVL\nL84:     pipeline = PaddleOCRVL(vl_rec_backend=\"vllm-server\", vl_rec_server_url=\"http://127.0.0.1:8080/v1\")\nL85:     output = pipeline.predict(\"https://paddle-model-ecology.bj.bcebos.com/paddlex/imgs/demo_image/paddleocr_vl_demo.png\")\nL86:     for res in output:\nL87:         res.print()\nL88:         res.save_to_json(save_path=\"output\")\nL89:         res.save_to_markdown(save_path=\"output\")\nL90:     `\nL91: 更多用法与参数说明请参阅 cite21†文档†www.paddleocr.ai 。\nL92: ### 使用 transformers 库推理 PaddleOCR-VL-1.5-0.9Bcite22†# L93: \nL94: 当前 PaddleOCR-VL-1.5-0.9B 支持通过 `transformers` 库进行无缝推理，覆盖 文本检测识别一体化，以及公式、表格、图表与印章等复杂元素识别。下面提供一个基于 `transformers` 的简单示例脚本。\nL95: > 注：当前仍推荐使用官方推理方式，其速度更快，并支持页面级文档解析。以下示例仅支持元素级识别与文本检测识别一体化。\nL96: \nL97:     `# ensure the transformers v5 is installed\nL98:     python -m pip install \"transformers>=5.0.0\"\nL99:     `\nL100: \nL101:     `from PIL import Image\nL102:     import torch\nL103:     from transformers import AutoProcessor, AutoModelForImageTextToText\nL104: \nL105:     # ---- Settings ----\nL106:     model_path = \"PaddlePaddle/PaddleOCR-VL-1.5\"\nL107:     image_path = \"test.png\"\nL108:     task = \"ocr\" # Options: 'ocr' | 'table' | 'chart' | 'formula' | 'spotting' | 'seal'\nL109:     # ------------------\nL110:     # ---- Image Preprocessing For Spotting ----\nL111:     image = Image.open(image_path).convert(\"RGB\")\nL112:     orig_w, orig_h = image.size\nL113:     spotting_upscale_threshold = 1500\nL114: \nL115:     if task == \"spotting\" and orig_w < spotting_upscale_threshold and orig_h < spotting_upscale_threshold:\nL116:         process_w, process_h = orig_w * 2, orig_h * 2\nL117:         try:\nL118:             resample_filter = Image.Resampling.LANCZOS\nL119:         except AttributeError:\nL120:             resample_filter = Image.LANCZOS\nL121:         image = image.resize((process_w, process_h), resample_filter)\nL122: \nL123:     # Set max_pixels: use 1605632 for spotting, otherwise use default ~1M pixels\nL124:     max_pixels = 2048 * 28 * 28 if task == \"spotting\" else 1280 * 28 * 28\nL125:     # ---------------------------\nL126: \nL127:     # -------- Inference --------\nL128:     DEVICE = \"cuda\" if torch.cuda.is_available() else \"cpu\"\nL129:     PROMPTS = {\nL130:         \"ocr\": \"OCR:\",\nL131:         \"table\": \"Table Recognition:\",\nL132:         \"formula\": \"Formula Recognition:\",\nL133:         \"chart\": \"Chart Recognition:\",\nL134:         \"spotting\": \"Spotting:\",\nL135:         \"seal\": \"Seal Recognition:\",\nL136:     }\nL137: \nL138:     model = AutoModelForImageTextToText.from_pretrained(model_path, torch_dtype=torch.bfloat16).to(DEVICE).eval()\nL139:     processor = AutoProcessor.from_pretrained(model_path)\nL140: \nL141:     messages = [\nL142:         {\nL143:             \"role\": \"user\",\nL144:             \"content\": [\nL145:                 {\"type\": \"image\", \"image\": image},\nL146:                 {\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": PROMPTS[task]},\nL147:             ]\nL148:         }\nL149:     ]\nL150:     inputs = processor.apply_chat_template(\nL151:         messages,\nL152:         add_generation_prompt=True,\nL153:         tokenize=True,\nL154:         return_dict=True,\nL155:         return_tensors=\"pt\",\nL156:         images_kwargs={\"size\": {\"shortest_edge\": processor.image_processor.min_pixels, \"longest_edge\": max_pixels}},\nL157:     ).to(model.device)\nL158: \nL159:     outputs = model.generate(**inputs, max_new_tokens=512)\nL160:     result = processor.decode(outputs[0][inputs[\"input_ids\"].shape[-1]:-1])\nL161:     print(result)\nL162:     # ---------------------------\nL163:     `\nL164: 可选项：使用 flash-attn 提升性能并降低显存占用\nL165: \nL166:     `# ensure the flash-attn2 is installed\nL167:     pip install flash-attn --no-build-isolation\nL168:     `\nL169: \nL170:     `model = AutoModelForImageTextToText.from_pretrained(model_path, torch_dtype=torch.bfloat16, attn_implementation=\"flash_attention_2\").to(DEVICE).eval()\nL171:     `\nL172: ## 性能表现cite23†# L173: \nL174: ### 文档解析cite24†# L175: \nL176: #### 1. OmniDocBench v1.5cite25†# L177: \nL178: PaddleOCR-VL-1.5 在 OmniDocBench v1.5 的整体指标、文本、公式、表格与阅读顺序等维度上均取得 SOTA 表现。\nL179: \nL180: cite26†Image: omnidocbenchv1.5_metrics L181: \nL182: > 注：\nL183: >\nL184: > 性能指标来自 cite27†OmniDocBench 官方排行榜†opendatalab.com ，其中 Gemini-3 Pro、Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct 以及 PaddleOCR-VL-1.5 为独立评测。\nL185: #### 2. Real5-OmniDocBenchcite28†# L186: \nL187: 在扫描、形变、屏幕拍摄、光照与倾斜五类复杂场景上，PaddleOCR-VL-1.5 持续刷新 SOTA 纪录。\nL188: \nL189: cite29†Image: real5omnidocbench L190: \nL191: > 注：\nL192: >\nL193: > Real5-OmniDocBench 是一个面向真实世界场景的全新基准，我们基于 OmniDocBench v1.5 数据集构建。该数据集包含五类场景：扫描、弯折、屏幕拍照、光线变化与倾斜。更多细节请参阅 cite30†Real5-OmniDocBench†huggingface.co 。\nL194: \nL195: ### 推理性能cite31†# L196: \nL197: cite32†Image: inference_performance L198: \nL199: > 注：\nL200: >\nL201: > OmniDocBench v1.5 上的端到端推理性能对比。PDF 文档在单张 NVIDIA A100 GPU 上以 batch size=512 进行推理。统计时间包含 PDF 渲染与 Markdown 生成。所有方法均使用各自默认 PDF 解析模块与 DPI 设置，以反映开箱即用的真实性能。\nL202: ## 可视化示例cite33†# L203: \nL204: 以下是一些 真实场景文档解析 示例。\nL205: \nL206: 光线变化\nL207: \nL208: cite34†Image: light L209: \nL210: 倾斜\nL211: \nL212: cite35†Image: skew L213: \nL214: 屏幕拍摄 cite36†Image: screen L215: \nL216: 扫描\nL217: \nL218: cite37†Image: scaning L219: \nL220: 弯折\nL221: \nL222: cite38†Image: curving L223: \nL224: 文本检测识别一体化\nL225: \nL226: cite39†Image: spotting L227: \nL228: 印章识别\nL229: \nL230: cite40†Image: seal L231: \nL232: ## 致谢cite41†# L233: \nL234: 感谢 cite42†PaddleFormers†github.com 、cite43†Keye†github.com 、cite44†MinerU†github.com 、cite45†OmniDocBench†github.com 提供宝贵的代码、模型权重与基准。也感谢社区的每一位贡献者！\nL235: ## 引用cite46†# L236: 如果你觉得 PaddleOCR-VL-1.5 有帮助，欢迎给我们点 Star 并引用。\nL237: \nL238:     `@misc{cui2026paddleocrvl15multitask09bvlm,\nL239:           title={PaddleOCR-VL-1.5: Towards a Multi-Task 0.9B VLM for Robust In-the-Wild Document Parsing},\nL240:           author={Cheng Cui and Ting Sun and Suyin Liang and T